          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abamarayika bose bari bahagaze bagose ya ntebe na ba bakuru na bya bizima bine, bikubita hasi bubamye imbere y'intebe, baramya Imana bati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amen, amahirwe n'icyubahiro n'ubwenge n'ishimwe, no guhimbazwa n'ubutware n'imbaraga bibe iby'Imana yacu iteka ryose, Amen.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
